---
const { compact = false } = Astro.props as { compact?: boolean };
---

<article class:list={['connected-project-card', { compact }]}>
  <div><span>BUILD ACROSS THE STACK</span><h2>Take one URL shortener from objects to Kubernetes.</h2></div>
  <p>Follow a connected project through LLD, Java, Spring Boot, caching, system design, Docker, Kubernetes and observability.</p>
  <a href="/projects/production-url-shortener/">Open the connected project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</article>

<style>
  .connected-project-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(16rem, .8fr) auto; align-items: center; gap: 1.2rem; padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: .9rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--indigo) 10%, transparent), transparent 54%), var(--surface); }
  .connected-project-card span { color: var(--amber); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: .55rem; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .09em; }
  .connected-project-card h2 { margin: .32rem 0 0; font-size: 1.25rem; }
  .connected-project-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--text-soft); font-size: .72rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .connected-project-card > a { padding: .62rem .75rem; border: 1px solid var(--indigo); border-radius: .55rem; color: var(--indigo); font-size: .66rem; font-weight: 650; white-space: nowrap; }
  .connected-project-card > a:hover { background: var(--indigo); color: white; }
  .connected-project-card > a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--indigo) 45%, transparent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .connected-project-card.compact { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }
  .connected-project-card.compact p { grid-column: 1; }
  .connected-project-card.compact > a { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1 / span 2; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .connected-project-card, .connected-project-card.compact { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .connected-project-card.compact p, .connected-project-card.compact > a { grid-column: auto; grid-row: auto; } .connected-project-card > a { justify-self: start; white-space: normal; } }
</style>
